N10. the lazy-caterer formula kappa(n) = 1 + C(n-2, 2)
PASS exact for n in [3, 4, 5, 6, 9] among 3 <= n <= 9 (above it at n = 7, 8)
PASS u(n) >= L(n) > 2n - 4 for 38 <= n <= 60; with u(n) >= C(k,2) + u(n-k), k = 1 + floor(log2 n) >= 6, C(k,2) >= 2k, this holds for all n >= 38

